type: software
title: "Domain Hunter — Bulk Domain Availability Checker & Name Generator"
abstract: >-
  Free, open-source, browser-only bulk domain availability checker.
  Direct RDAP checks against 140+ TLD registries, five name generators,
  live registrar prices with 3-year TCO, CSV export. No servers,
  no API keys, no tracking.
